{
  "id": "dmwbbmendzrwa",
  "name": "手势方向锁定",
  "tags": [
    "交互",
    "切换",
    "动画"
  ],
  "aliases": [],
  "summary": "可横滑的卡片区里，手指动起来后先判断方向：横向就卡片跟手横移、松手吸附换卡；纵向则让页面正常滚动，不抢手势。方向锁定后本次手势不再来回改，鼠标拖拽同样有效。",
  "usage": "卡片横滑和页面纵向滚动共用一块区域的移动端页面，如推荐卡、引导卡、横向筛选带。",
  "caution": "需要双指缩放或长按拖动的区域别叠加单指方向锁；阈值低于 6px 容易在轻微抖动时误判。",
  "hint": "卡片上横着拖切换、竖着拖滚动列表；鼠标拖同样有效。",
  "inspiration": "",
  "prompt": "【手势方向锁定】目标：横滑卡片与纵向滚动共用一块区域时，先累计位移判主轴，再决定谁响应；锁定后本次手势不再改轴。\n\n1) 结构：stage（高 100%、overflow-y:auto、touch-action:pan-y、自绘细滚动条）> cardbox（圆角 13px、overflow:hidden、touch-action:pan-y、user-select:none）> track（flex、will-change:transform）> 3 张 card（flex:0 0 100%，step 等于 cardbox 内容宽）；cardbox 下方是 3 个小圆点；再往下是 feed 列表——**至少 30 行**，内容总高度要明显超过容器高度，否则纵向滚动没有可滚空间，「不劫持」的分支根本体验不到。\n\n2) 轴判定：在 stage 上监听 pointerdown（跳过 button），记 x0/y0、baseX（track 当前位移）、baseScroll（stage.scrollTop），axis = null。pointermove 里先算 dx/dy：max(|dx|,|dy|) < 8px 时直接 return，不表态；超过后当 |dx| > |dy|*1.15 锁横向，|dy| > |dx|*1.15 锁纵向，接近对角时按较大者归属。axis 一旦赋值本次手势不再改。\n\n3) 横向：锁 x 后每帧写 track.style.transform = translateX(clampX(baseX+dx))，clampX 在 [-(N-1)*W, 0] 之外用 0.28 阻尼。松手按 round(-x/W) 吸附，vx < -0.5px/ms 时取 ceil（向后翻一张）、vx > 0.5 取 floor，再用 el.animate 到 -index*W（320ms，cubic-bezier(.22,.82,.24,1)）。圆点同步高亮，宽度从 4px 伸到 12px。\n\n4) 纵向：锁 y 后不劫持——真实触摸交给浏览器（touch-action:pan-y 已在监听开始前配好，不能中途改），鼠标拖拽用 stage.scrollTop = baseScroll - dy 模拟原生滚动。此时 track 的位移保持 0，绝不横向跟手。注意：拖拽方向决定能否滚动，从顶部往下拖不会动（这是正确的，不是坏了），所以演示和自测都应该是**往上拖**（dy 为负 → scrollTop 增大）。\n\n5) 取消/反向/快速重复：pointercancel 时横向吸附回当前 index；换方向不会改轴（这是设计目标，避免来回抖）；中途反向拖动，位移直接反向走，不堆叠动画；pointerdown 时先量 mid → cancel 吸附动画 → 写回内联值，实现中断接管。\n\n6) 键盘替代：← → 切换卡片（snapTo），列表用浏览器原生滚动，role=status 播报「已切到第 N 张」。\n\n7) 无障碍与降级：prefers-reduced-motion 下吸附直接落位；卡片区标记 aria-roledescription=\"横向卡片\" 与「第 N 张，共 3 张」。\n\n8) 配色：只用 --ui-*。卡片底 color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-brand) 9%, var(--ui-surface))，边框 color-mix(brand 22%)，列表行 color-mix(text 4%)，轴徽标用 brand 底 + var(--ui-bg) 文字。\n\n9) 坑：\n   - 触摸行为要在 pointerdown 之前用 CSS 配好；阈值低于 6px 会在轻微抖动时误判；锁定后不要再根据后续位移改轴。\n   - stage 的滚动条必须自绘（::-webkit-scrollbar 一套，scrollbar-width 包在 @supports not selector(::-webkit-scrollbar) 里），否则 Windows 上是带箭头的系统条。\n   - **列表行数要够**：4 行内容在卡片里勉强能滚，但到 740×733 的放大弹窗里内容比容器还矮，完全滚不动，用户会以为「纵向不劫持」是坏的。给 30 行以上（含真实感的标题和时间），并在列表标题右侧写「纵向可滚 · 共 N 条」提示。\n   - **弹窗尺寸下要同步放大**：@media (min-height:421px) 里把卡片高 72→112px、标题 12→19px、列表行 28→44px、字号 9.5→14px，否则 740 宽下又扁又宽、字小得看不清。\n\n10) 自动演示：包在 !window.__uiInteractive 里。第一轮在卡片上横向拖 -W*0.5 → release → 吸附第 2 张；第二轮在列表上纵向拖 44px（同时改 scrollTop）→ release；然后卡片回第 1 张、列表滚回顶部 → hide 后约 1.1 秒循环。拖动期间右上角显示「横向 · 切卡片 / 纵向 · 滚页面」徽标，松手淡出。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>手势方向锁定</title>\n<style>\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html,body{height:100%}\n  body{margin:0;background:var(--ui-bg);color:var(--ui-text);overflow:hidden;\n    font:13px/1.35 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}\n  .stage{height:100%;overflow-y:auto;overflow-x:hidden;overscroll-behavior:contain;\n    padding:10px 12px 12px;touch-action:pan-y}\n  .stage::-webkit-scrollbar{width:10px;height:10px}\n  .stage::-webkit-scrollbar-button{display:none;width:0;height:0}\n  .stage::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:transparent;margin:6px 0}\n  .stage::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 30%,transparent);\n    border:3px solid transparent;border-right-width:4px;\n    background-clip:padding-box;border-radius:999px}\n  .stage::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 50%,transparent);\n    background-clip:padding-box}\n  .stage::-webkit-scrollbar-corner{background:transparent}\n  @supports not selector(::-webkit-scrollbar){\n    .stage{scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--ui-text-dim) transparent}\n  }\n  .cardbox{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:13px;\n    background:var(--ui-bg);\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 7%,var(--ui-bg));\n    border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent);\n    padding:6px 6px 4px;touch-action:pan-y;\n    -webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none}\n  .track{display:flex;will-change:transform;cursor:grab}\n  .track:active{cursor:grabbing}\n  .card{flex:0 0 100%;padding-right:6px;min-width:0}\n  .card:last-child{padding-right:0}\n  .cbody{height:72px;border-radius:10px;padding:7px 9px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\n    background:var(--ui-surface);\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 9%,var(--ui-surface));\n    border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 22%,transparent)}\n  .k{font-size:8px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);letter-spacing:.06em}\n  .cbody b{font-size:12px;font-weight:650;margin-top:2px;line-height:1.2}\n  .cbody p{margin:auto 0 0;font-size:9px;line-height:1.35;color:var(--ui-text-dim);\n    white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n  .dots{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;height:12px}\n  .dots i{width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:50%;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 28%,transparent);\n    transition:width .22s ease,background .22s ease}\n  .dots i.on{width:12px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ui-brand)}\n  .feed{padding:8px 2px 0}\n  .fh{font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ui-text-dim);padding:0 2px 5px;\n    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .fh span{font-weight:400;font-size:8.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n  .fi{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;height:28px;padding:0 8px;border-radius:8px;\n    margin-bottom:4px;\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-surface));\n    border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 8%,transparent)}\n  .sq{flex:0 0 auto;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:3px;\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 55%,transparent)}\n  .fi b{flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:550;\n    white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n  .fi i{flex:0 0 auto;font-style:normal;font-size:8px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n  .badge{position:fixed;right:9px;top:8px;z-index:20;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\n    padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:9px;line-height:1.3;pointer-events:none;\n    color:var(--ui-bg);\n    background:var(--ui-brand);\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 92%,var(--ui-bg));\n    box-shadow:0 3px 10px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 18%,transparent);\n    opacity:0;transform:translateY(-3px);transition:opacity .16s ease,transform .16s ease}\n  .badge.show{opacity:1;transform:none}\n  .sr{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n  .demo-cursor.sweeping{transition:none}\n  @media (max-height:420px){\n    .stage{padding:9px 10px 10px}\n    .cbody{height:66px;padding:6px 8px}\n    .cbody b{font-size:11px}\n    .fi{height:26px}\n  }\n  /* 放大弹窗（740×733）：按宽屏比例放大卡片和列表行，否则 72px 的卡片又扁又宽、9.5px 的字看不清 */\n  @media (min-height:421px){\n    .stage{padding:16px 20px 20px}\n    .cardbox{border-radius:16px;padding:8px 8px 6px}\n    .cbody{height:112px;border-radius:13px;padding:12px 16px}\n    .k{font-size:11px}\n    .cbody b{font-size:19px;margin-top:3px}\n    .cbody p{font-size:12.5px}\n    .dots{height:18px;gap:6px}\n    .dots i{width:5px;height:5px}\n    .dots i.on{width:16px}\n    .feed{padding-top:12px}\n    .fh{font-size:13px;padding-bottom:8px}\n    .fh span{font-size:11px}\n    .fi{height:44px;padding:0 14px;gap:10px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:7px}\n    .sq{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:4px}\n    .fi b{font-size:14px}\n    .fi i{font-size:11px}\n    .badge{font-size:12px;padding:5px 11px;right:16px;top:14px}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"stage\" id=\"stage\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"可横向切换卡片、纵向滚动的页面\">\n  <div class=\"cardbox\" id=\"cardbox\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"横向卡片\" aria-label=\"本周概览，横向滑动切换\">\n    <div class=\"track\" id=\"track\">\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-label=\"第 1 张，共 3 张\">\n        <div class=\"cbody\">\n          <span class=\"k\">01 / 概览</span>\n          <b>本周进度</b>\n          <p>已完成 7 / 10 项，还有 3 项待跟进</p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-label=\"第 2 张，共 3 张\">\n        <div class=\"cbody\">\n          <span class=\"k\">02 / 协作</span>\n          <b>谁在等你</b>\n          <p>2 条评审待回，1 条设计走查</p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-label=\"第 3 张，共 3 张\">\n        <div class=\"cbody\">\n          <span class=\"k\">03 / 节奏</span>\n          <b>下周焦点</b>\n          <p>版本收尾，集中在周三之前</p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dots\" id=\"dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i><i></i></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"feed\">\n    <div class=\"fh\">今日动态<span>纵向可滚 · 共 36 条</span></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>设计稿评审通过</b><i>10:24</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>接口文档更新了 3 处</b><i>09:50</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>周报已自动归档</b><i>09:12</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>下周排期待确认</b><i>昨天</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>版本 2.4 已发布</b><i>昨天</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>三条未读评论待回</b><i>昨天</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>组件库同步完成</b><i>周二</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>测试环境已重置</b><i>周二</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>需求评审改到周四</b><i>周一</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>灰度比例升到 30%</b><i>周一</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>埋点字段新增 2 个</b><i>周一</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>数据看板刷新完成</b><i>周日</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>两张设计走查已关闭</b><i>周日</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>接口超时告警已恢复</b><i>周六</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>部署窗口调整为凌晨</b><i>周六</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>权限申请已通过</b><i>周五</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>文档目录重整完成</b><i>周五</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>三位同事加入项目</b><i>周四</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>安全扫描 0 高风险</b><i>周四</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>移动端适配复查</b><i>周三</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>空状态文案已更新</b><i>周三</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>加载动效上线</b><i>周三</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>反馈问卷回收 42 份</b><i>周二</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>用户访谈记录归档</b><i>上周</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>竞品分析初稿完成</b><i>上周</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>图标资源重新导出</b><i>上周</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>埋点校验脚本更新</b><i>上周</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>季度复盘材料归档</b><i>上周</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>接口耗时优化 18%</b><i>两周前</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>设计规范补了两节</b><i>两周前</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>帮助中心新增 5 篇</b><i>两周前</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>邮箱模板已重做</b><i>两周前</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>账单页字段对齐</b><i>三周前</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>导出失败已修复</b><i>三周前</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>通知分组上线</b><i>三周前</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>旧版接口已下线</b><i>三周前</i></div>\n    <div class=\"fi\"><span class=\"sq\"></span><b>季度目标已同步</b><i>一个月前</i></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"badge\" id=\"badge\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span id=\"badgeTxt\">横向</span></div>\n<div class=\"sr\" id=\"live\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  \"use strict\";\n  var stage = document.getElementById(\"stage\");\n  var cardbox = document.getElementById(\"cardbox\");\n  var track = document.getElementById(\"track\");\n  var dots = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll(\"#dots i\"));\n  var badge = document.getElementById(\"badge\");\n  var badgeTxt = document.getElementById(\"badgeTxt\");\n  var live = document.getElementById(\"live\");\n  var N = dots.length;\n  var LOCK = 8;          /* 位移超过 8px 才判定主轴 */\n  var RATIO = 1.15;      /* 主轴要比副轴明显占优，避免对角线乱抖 */\n\n  var W = 0, index = 0;\n  var anim = null;\n  var reduced = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia(\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\").matches;\n  var cursor = null, demoTimer = null;\n  var g = {down:false, x0:0, y0:0, axis:null, pid:null, baseX:0, baseScroll:0,\n           vx:0, lastX:0, lastT:0, inCards:false};\n\n  function measure(){ W = cardbox.clientWidth - 12; }  /* 去掉卡片框 6px 的内边距 */\n  function curX(){\n    var t = getComputedStyle(track).transform;\n    if (!t || t === \"none\") return 0;\n    var m = t.match(/matrix\\(([^)]+)\\)/);\n    return m ? parseFloat(m[1].split(\",\")[4]) : 0;\n  }\n  function clampX(x){\n    var min = -(N - 1) * W, max = 0;\n    if (x > max) return max + (x - max) * 0.28;\n    if (x < min) return min + (x - min) * 0.28;\n    return x;\n  }\n  function setBadge(axis){\n    if (!axis){ badge.classList.remove(\"show\"); return; }\n    badgeTxt.textContent = axis === \"x\" ? \"横向 · 切卡片\" : \"纵向 · 滚页面\";\n    badge.classList.add(\"show\");\n  }\n  function setIndex(i){\n    index = Math.max(0, Math.min(N - 1, i));\n    dots.forEach(function(d, k){ d.classList.toggle(\"on\", k === index); });\n    track.setAttribute(\"aria-label\", \"第 \" + (index + 1) + \" 张，共 \" + N + \" 张\");\n    live.textContent = \"已切到第 \" + (index + 1) + \" 张卡片\";\n  }\n  function snapTo(i, dur){\n    setIndex(i);\n    var to = -index * W, from = curX();\n    if (anim){ try{ anim.cancel(); }catch(e){} anim = null; }\n    if (reduced || Math.abs(to - from) < 0.6){\n      track.style.transform = \"translateX(\" + to + \"px)\";\n      return;\n    }\n    var a = track.animate([\n      {transform:\"translateX(\" + from + \"px)\"},\n      {transform:\"translateX(\" + to + \"px)\"}\n    ], {duration: dur || 320, easing:\"cubic-bezier(.22,.82,.24,1)\", fill:\"both\"});\n    anim = a;\n    a.onfinish = function(){\n      track.style.transform = \"translateX(\" + to + \"px)\";\n      try{ a.cancel(); }catch(e){}\n      if (anim === a) anim = null;\n    };\n  }\n  function releaseSnap(){\n    var x = curX(), raw = -x / W, target = Math.round(raw);\n    if (g.vx < -0.5) target = Math.max(Math.ceil(raw), index + 1);\n    else if (g.vx > 0.5) target = Math.min(Math.floor(raw), index - 1);\n    snapTo(target);\n  }\n\n  stage.addEventListener(\"pointerdown\", function(e){\n    if (e.pointerType === \"mouse\" && e.button !== 0) return;\n    if (e.target.closest && e.target.closest(\"button\")) return;\n    measure();\n    /* 中断接管：先量当前实际位置，再停掉旧动画，避免画面跳回动画起点 */\n    var mid = curX();\n    if (anim){ try{ anim.cancel(); }catch(e2){} anim = null; }\n    track.style.transform = \"translateX(\" + mid + \"px)\";\n    g.down = true; g.pid = e.pointerId;\n    g.x0 = e.clientX; g.y0 = e.clientY;\n    g.axis = null; g.inCards = !!(e.target.closest && e.target.closest(\"#cardbox\"));\n    g.baseX = mid; g.baseScroll = stage.scrollTop;\n    g.lastX = e.clientX; g.lastT = performance.now(); g.vx = 0;\n    try{ stage.setPointerCapture(g.pid); }catch(e2){}\n  });\n\n  stage.addEventListener(\"pointermove\", function(e){\n    if (!g.down) return;\n    var dx = e.clientX - g.x0, dy = e.clientY - g.y0;\n    if (!g.axis){\n      var ax = Math.abs(dx), ay = Math.abs(dy);\n      if (Math.max(ax, ay) < LOCK) return;            /* 阈值内不表态，先累计位移 */\n      if (g.inCards && ax > ay * RATIO) g.axis = \"x\";\n      else if (g.inCards && ay > ax * RATIO) g.axis = \"y\";\n      else g.axis = g.inCards ? (ax > ay ? \"x\" : \"y\") : \"y\";\n      setBadge(g.axis);\n      if (g.axis === \"x\") cardbox.classList.add(\"dragging\");\n    }\n    var now = performance.now(), dt = now - g.lastT;\n    if (dt > 0){\n      g.vx = g.vx * 0.65 + ((e.clientX - g.lastX) / dt) * 0.35;\n      g.lastX = e.clientX; g.lastT = now;\n    }\n    if (g.axis === \"x\"){\n      e.preventDefault();\n      /* 跟手：每帧直接写位移，没有 transition 追赶 */\n      track.style.transform = \"translateX(\" + clampX(g.baseX + dx).toFixed(2) + \"px)\";\n    } else {\n      /* 纵向锁定：不劫持。触摸交给原生 scroll（pan-y），鼠标拖动用 scrollTop 模拟 */\n      if (e.pointerType === \"mouse\"){\n        e.preventDefault();\n        stage.scrollTop = g.baseScroll - dy;\n      }\n    }\n  });\n\n  function end(){\n    if (!g.down) return;\n    g.down = false;\n    cardbox.classList.remove(\"dragging\");\n    if (g.pid !== null){ try{ stage.releasePointerCapture(g.pid); }catch(e){} g.pid = null; }\n    if (g.axis === \"x\") releaseSnap();\n    g.axis = null; g.vx = 0;\n    setBadge(null);\n  }\n  stage.addEventListener(\"pointerup\", end);\n  stage.addEventListener(\"pointercancel\", function(){\n    if (!g.down) return;\n    g.down = false;\n    cardbox.classList.remove(\"dragging\");\n    if (g.pid !== null){ try{ stage.releasePointerCapture(g.pid); }catch(e){} g.pid = null; }\n    if (g.axis === \"x\") snapTo(index);\n    g.axis = null; g.vx = 0;\n    setBadge(null);\n  });\n\n  document.addEventListener(\"keydown\", function(e){\n    if (e.key === \"ArrowRight\" && index < N - 1){ snapTo(index + 1); }\n    else if (e.key === \"ArrowLeft\" && index > 0){ snapTo(index - 1); }\n  });\n\n  function tween(dur, from, to, onStep, done){\n    if (reduced){ onStep(to); if (done) done(); return; }\n    var t0 = performance.now();\n    function frame(t){\n      var p = Math.min(1, (t - t0) / dur);\n      var e = 1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 2.3);\n      onStep(from + (to - from) * e);\n      if (p < 1) requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n      else if (done) done();\n    }\n    requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n  }\n  function wait(ms, fn){ demoTimer = setTimeout(fn, ms); }\n\n  function startDemo(){\n    if (g.down){ wait(400, startDemo); return; }\n    if (typeof window.__uiDemoCursor !== \"function\") return;\n    var cr = cardbox.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var fr = stage.getBoundingClientRect();\n    if (!cr.width || !fr.height){ wait(400, startDemo); return; }\n    if (!cursor) cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    if (!cursor || !cursor.el) return;\n    measure();\n    var cx = cr.left + cr.width * 0.78, cy = cr.top + 34;\n    cursor.el.classList.add(\"show\");\n    cursor.at(cx, cy);\n    wait(520, function(){\n      cursor.press();\n      cursor.el.classList.add(\"sweeping\");\n      cursor.at(cx, cy);\n      /* 第一轮：横向拖，锁定横向，卡片跟手横移后吸附到下一张 */\n      tween(520, 0, -W * 0.5, function(dx){\n        track.style.transform = \"translateX(\" + clampX(dx).toFixed(2) + \"px)\";\n        cursor.at(cx + dx, cy);\n      }, function(){\n        cursor.release();\n        snapTo(index + 1, 300);\n        cursor.el.classList.remove(\"sweeping\");\n        wait(700, function(){\n          /* 第二轮：在列表上纵向拖，锁定纵向，页面正常滚动 */\n          var fx = fr.left + fr.width * 0.4, fy = fr.top + fr.height * 0.74;\n          cursor.el.classList.remove(\"sweeping\");\n          cursor.at(fx, fy);\n          wait(480, function(){\n            cursor.press();\n            cursor.el.classList.add(\"sweeping\");\n            var base = stage.scrollTop;\n            tween(500, 0, 44, function(dy){\n              stage.scrollTop = base + dy;\n              cursor.at(fx, fy + dy);\n            }, function(){\n              cursor.release();\n              cursor.el.classList.remove(\"sweeping\");\n              wait(620, function(){\n                cursor.hide();\n                /* 复位：卡片回第一张，列表滚回顶部 */\n                snapTo(0, 300);\n                var from = stage.scrollTop, t0 = performance.now();\n                (function back(){\n                  var p = Math.min(1, (performance.now() - t0) / 320);\n                  stage.scrollTop = from * (1 - p);\n                  if (p < 1) requestAnimationFrame(back);\n                  else wait(1100, startDemo);\n                })();\n              });\n            });\n          });\n        });\n      });\n    });\n  }\n\n  measure();\n  track.style.transform = \"translateX(0px)\";\n  if (!window.__uiInteractive){\n    demoTimer = setTimeout(startDemo, 340);\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n",
